# Delivery evidence photos.
#
# These are not public product images: they show a customer's parcel and,
# on a delivery photo, often their doorstep. The directory is blocked
# entirely and the files are served through admin/evidence.php, which
# checks the viewer is allowed to see that order first.
Require all denied

<IfModule !mod_authz_core.c>
    Order deny,allow
    Deny from all
</IfModule>
